guide forever/class/priest/touch-of-weakness-and-dark-sacrifice
title Touch of Weakness and Dark Sacrifice
category Class
class Priest
folder Priest
faction Horde
race Undead
levels 10-20
zone Undercity
keywords Touch of Weakness, Dark Sacrifice, Devouring Plague, Aelthalyste, Tai'jin, Var'jun, Ur'kyo, Miles Welsh, War Quarter, Undead, Forsaken, racial, Priest
reward spell 2652 "Touch of Weakness"
reward spell 1277324 "Dark Sacrifice"
why The Undead priest spells: Touch of Weakness at 10, Dark Sacrifice (new in Forever) at 20. Free, no objectives.

# The Undead Priest spell quests. Each spell has one quest at the teacher,
# Aelthalyste (War Quarter, Undercity), and letters from priest trainers in
# other towns; any one teaches the spell and the game offers only one of a
# set:
#   Touch of Weakness (level 10):
#     5658 Aelthalyste (Undercity), her own quest
#     5660 Tai'jin (Razor Hill, Durotar)
#     5661 Var'jun (by Bloodhoof Village, Mulgore)
#     5662 Ur'kyo (Valley of Spirits, Orgrimmar)
#     5663 Miles Welsh (Spirit Rise, Thunder Bluff)
#   Dark Sacrifice (level 20; Devouring Plague renamed, teaches Dark
#   Sacrifice, and every priest trains Devouring Plague in Forever):
#     5679 Aelthalyste (Undercity), her own quest
#     5644 Miles Welsh (Thunder Bluff)
#     5646 Ur'kyo (Orgrimmar)
# Left out: 5659 Touch of Weakness has no giver in any source and its
# Forever quest page is titled "<NYI>"; the "<NYI>" placeholders 5691-5693
# (In the Dark It was Created) and 5704-5706 (Undead Priest Robe, No Longer a
# Shadow) were never put in the game.
# The guide sends you to the giver in the zone you stand in when it gets
# there (`when zone`), else straight to Aelthalyste; a letter you carry from
# anywhere is handed in on its own step (`when onquest`). Pickups are `talk`
# goals, not accepts: one guide accepting two quests of one exclusive set
# warns in lint, which does not follow `when`.
# Sources: quests.json and npcs.json for the givers; Forever's quest pages
# (snapshot) agree on every giver; Forever's Priest class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): Dark Sacrifice (5644, 5646, 5679) is Devouring
# Plague renamed; Touch of Weakness unchanged (now lowers the attacker's
# melee attack power). Dark Sacrifice trades 440 of your health over 15 sec
# for mana, 10-minute cooldown (Forever web guides to the priest racials).
# horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades carries Touch of Weakness 5658 on the
# route; horde/04-the-barrens and 05-stonetalon-mountains carry 5646.
# Based on data, not play: written from the sources above.

step Touch of Weakness: Tai'jin
  when zone "Durotar"
  when !onquest 5658,5660,5661,5662,5663
  zone Durotar
  tip At 10 in Durotar, Tai'jin, the priest trainer inside the barracks of Razor Hill, hands you a Touch of Weakness letter for Aelthalyste in the Undercity.
  level 10
  talk 3706                                   -- Tai'jin: take his Touch of Weakness letter

step Touch of Weakness: Ur'kyo
  when zone "Orgrimmar"
  when !onquest 5658,5660,5661,5662,5663
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 10 in Orgrimmar, Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits hands you a Touch of Weakness letter for Aelthalyste in the Undercity. The zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades leaves from the tower outside Orgrimmar's front gate.
  level 10
  talk 6018                                   -- Ur'kyo: take his Touch of Weakness letter

step Touch of Weakness: Var'jun
  when zone "Mulgore"
  when !onquest 5658,5660,5661,5662,5663
  zone Mulgore
  tip At 10 in Mulgore, Var'jun, just south-west of Bloodhoof Village, hands you a Touch of Weakness letter for Aelthalyste in the Undercity.
  level 10
  talk 11407                                  -- Var'jun: take the Touch of Weakness letter

step Touch of Weakness: Miles Welsh
  when zone "Thunder Bluff"
  when !onquest 5658,5660,5661,5662,5663
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 10 in Thunder Bluff, Miles Welsh, the priest trainer in the cave under Spirit Rise, hands you a Touch of Weakness letter for Aelthalyste in the Undercity.
  level 10
  talk 3044                                   -- Miles Welsh: take his Touch of Weakness letter

step Touch of Weakness: Aelthalyste
  when !onquest 5658,5660,5661,5662,5663
  zone Undercity
  tip At 10, go to Aelthalyste, the priest trainer in the Undercity's War Quarter: she gives Touch of Weakness and takes it back at once. No letter needed. From Brill, follow the road south to the ruined city of Lordaeron; the Undercity's lifts are at the back of the throne room. Touch of Weakness strikes the next melee attacker for Shadow damage and lowers its melee attack power for 2 minutes.
  level 10
  accept 5658                                 -- Aelthalyste
  turnin 5658                                 -- Aelthalyste: Touch of Weakness

step Touch of Weakness: Tai'jin's letter
  when onquest 5660
  zone Undercity
  tip Hand the letter to Aelthalyste in the Undercity's War Quarter: the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar lands in Tirisfal Glades, a short walk from the Undercity.
  turnin 5660                                 -- Aelthalyste: Touch of Weakness

step Touch of Weakness: Var'jun's letter
  when onquest 5661
  zone Undercity
  tip Hand the letter to Aelthalyste in the Undercity's War Quarter: travel to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades.
  turnin 5661                                 -- Aelthalyste: Touch of Weakness

step Touch of Weakness: Ur'kyo's letter
  when onquest 5662
  zone Undercity
  tip Hand the letter to Aelthalyste in the Undercity's War Quarter: the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar lands in Tirisfal Glades.
  turnin 5662                                 -- Aelthalyste: Touch of Weakness

step Touch of Weakness: Miles Welsh's letter
  when onquest 5663
  zone Undercity
  tip Hand the letter to Aelthalyste in the Undercity's War Quarter: travel to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades.
  turnin 5663                                 -- Aelthalyste: Touch of Weakness

step Dark Sacrifice: Ur'kyo
  when zone "Orgrimmar"
  when !onquest 5679,5644,5646
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 20 in Orgrimmar, Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits hands you a Dark Sacrifice letter for Aelthalyste in the Undercity.
  level 20
  talk 6018                                   -- Ur'kyo: take his Dark Sacrifice letter

step Dark Sacrifice: Miles Welsh
  when zone "Thunder Bluff"
  when !onquest 5679,5644,5646
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 20 in Thunder Bluff, Miles Welsh in the cave under Spirit Rise hands you a Dark Sacrifice letter for Aelthalyste in the Undercity.
  level 20
  talk 3044                                   -- Miles Welsh: take his Dark Sacrifice letter

step Dark Sacrifice: Aelthalyste
  when !onquest 5679,5644,5646
  zone Undercity
  tip At 20, Aelthalyste in the War Quarter teaches Dark Sacrifice with a quest she gives and takes back at once (its text still speaks of Devouring Plague, which every priest now learns from the trainer).
  level 20
  accept 5679                                 -- Aelthalyste
  turnin 5679                                 -- Aelthalyste: Dark Sacrifice

step Dark Sacrifice: Ur'kyo's letter
  when onquest 5646
  zone Undercity
  tip Hand the letter to Aelthalyste in the Undercity's War Quarter: the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar lands in Tirisfal Glades.
  turnin 5646                                 -- Aelthalyste: Dark Sacrifice

step Dark Sacrifice: Miles Welsh's letter
  when onquest 5644
  zone Undercity
  tip Hand the letter to Aelthalyste in the Undercity's War Quarter: travel to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades.
  turnin 5644                                 -- Aelthalyste: Dark Sacrifice
